    {
      "id": "mot17",
      "title": {
        "en": "Tracking comparison · MOT17 expanded cohort",
        "zh": "追蹤比較 · MOT17 擴大場景組"
      },
      "note": {
        "en": "Only these three rows share the same three sequences, cached detector input and evaluator. Lower ID switches can coexist with more missed observations.",
        "zh": "僅下方三筆共用同組三段序列、偵測快取與評估器；換 ID 較少可能同時伴隨更多漏追。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "parameters",
      "title": {
        "en": "Tracking follow-ups · separate cohorts",
        "zh": "追蹤後續研究 · 場景組分開"
      },
      "note": {
        "en": "Different data/configurations from the expanded cohort. Open each report for all profiles, per-scene scores, zeros and rejected candidates.",
        "zh": "資料與配置不同於上組；各報告保留全部配置、逐場景分數、零值與未通過候選，不跨組排名。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "audits",
      "title": {
        "en": "Current controls & read-only diagnosis",
        "zh": "目前控制實驗與只讀診斷"
      },
      "note": {
        "en": "GT-free means no ground-truth scoring in these studies. A diagnosis can complete while the original control gate remains failed. Defaults and weak continuation remain unchanged.",
        "zh": "GT-free 研究未讀取真值評分；稽核完成不會把原控制門檻改判通過，預設與弱偵測延續保留。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "browsers",
      "title": {
        "en": "Saved-result website · Linux browser builds",
        "zh": "保存結果網站 · Linux 瀏覽器版本"
      },
      "note": {
        "en": "Dated headed and headless modes are recorded separately on the same browser rows. The unique frozen matrix remains 33 passed / 31 not run; repeated modes are not extra browsers.",
        "zh": "有視窗／無頭分開留證，同一瀏覽器不重複加列；唯一凍結矩陣仍為 33 通過／31 未測，完整驗收尚未完成。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "platforms",
      "title": {
        "en": "Installation, camera & missing platforms",
        "zh": "安裝、相機與未驗證平台"
      },
      "note": {
        "en": "CI/API-import success does not certify fresh pretrained inference, physical capture, calibration or sustained device performance.",
        "zh": "CI／API 匯入成功不等於全新真權重推論、實體擷取、標定精度或長時間裝置效能通過。"
      }
